# Slack OAuth credentials (never commit real values)
SLACK_CLIENT_ID=
SLACK_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Used later for Events API / Socket Mode verification (optional for OAuth)
SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=
# Must match the Redirect URL configured in your Slack app
SLACK_REDIRECT_URI=https://localhost/slack/oauth/callback

# Admin gate (no database — checked against these values only)
ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
ADMIN_PASSWORD=changeme
# Optional alias for ADMIN_USERNAME:
# ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com


Correct command for this laptop

/home/creator/Desktop/Orbit-Dashboards does not exist. The actual repo is:
cd /home/lap-19/Desktop/Company-Project-dashboard/slack-dashboard-main && \
pnpm run build && \
ELECTRON_OZONE_PLATFORM_HINT=x11 pnpm exec electron out/main/index.js \
  --no-sandbox --disable-dev-shm-usage --disable-gpu \
  --disable-gpu-compositing --ozone-platform=x11
Headless session variant, which I used to verify:
cd /home/lap-19/Desktop/Company-Project-dashboard/slack-dashboard-main && \
xvfb-run -a env ELECTRON_OZONE_PLATFORM_HINT=x11 pnpm exec electron out/main/index.js \
  --no-sandbox --disable-dev-shm-usage --disable-gpu \
  --disable-gpu-compositing --ozone-platform=x11